  "solution": "Given:\n\n(0.064)123 ÷ 0.1647 × 0.434 × 0.429 = (0.4)?\n\nConcept used:\n\n1. Ap ÷ Aq = Ap ⁻q\n\n2. Ap × Aq = Ap ⁺ q\n\nCalculation:\n\n(0.064)123 ÷ 0.1647 × 0.434 × 0.429\n\n⇒ ((0.4)³)123 ÷ ((0.4)²)47 × 0.434 × 0.429\n\n⇒ (0.4)369 ÷ (0.4)94 × 0.434 × 0.429\n\n⇒ (0.4)369 - 94 × 0.4⁽³⁴ ⁺ ²⁹⁾\n\n⇒ (0.4)²⁷⁵ × 0.4⁶³\n\n⇒ (0.4)275 + 63\n\n⇒ (0.4)³³⁸\n\n**∴ (0.064)123 ÷ 0.1647 × 0.434 × 0.429 equals (0.4)338.**",
